@rel = http://localhost:4004/release
@cargo = http://localhost:4004/cargo
@machinery = 21000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001
@passOut = 72000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001
@passIn = 72000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002
@exportBox = 22000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001

### 1) Should FAIL with 2 errors: DO for an EXPORT B/L, issued to a SHIPPER
POST {{rel}}/DeliveryOrders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bl_ID": "11000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003",
  "issuedBy_ID": "b1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
  "issuedTo_ID": "b1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005",
  "validUntil": "2026-11-30"
}

### 2) Should FAIL: machinery container – Bill of Entry only DUTY_PAID, not CLEARED
POST {{rel}}/GatePasses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ID": "{{passOut}}",
  "movement": "OUT",
  "container_ID": "{{machinery}}",
  "deliveryOrder_ID": "61000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
  "transporter_ID": "b1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000007",
  "truckNumber": "KL07AB1234",
  "validFrom": "2026-11-15T00:00:00Z",
  "validTo": "2026-11-19T00:00:00Z"
}

### 3) Customs clears the machinery Bill of Entry
POST {{cargo}}/CustomsDeclarations(31000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001)/CargoService.clear
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 4) Same gate pass → now SUCCEEDS (GP-2026-0003)
POST {{rel}}/GatePasses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ID": "{{passOut}}",
  "movement": "OUT",
  "container_ID": "{{machinery}}",
  "deliveryOrder_ID": "61000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
  "transporter_ID": "b1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000007",
  "truckNumber": "KL07AB1234",
  "validFrom": "2026-11-15T00:00:00Z",
  "validTo": "2026-11-19T00:00:00Z"
}

### 5) Should FAIL: a second open pass for the same container
POST {{rel}}/GatePasses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "movement": "OUT",
  "container_ID": "{{machinery}}",
  "deliveryOrder_ID": "61000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
  "truckNumber": "KL07ZZ9999",
  "validFrom": "2026-11-15T00:00:00Z",
  "validTo": "2026-11-19T00:00:00Z"
}

### 6) Should FAIL with 3 errors: paint container (HOLD, BOE not cleared, DO is for another B/L)
POST {{rel}}/GatePasses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "movement": "OUT",
  "container_ID": "21000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003",
  "deliveryOrder_ID": "61000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
  "truckNumber": "KL07AB5555",
  "validFrom": "2026-11-15T00:00:00Z",
  "validTo": "2026-11-19T00:00:00Z"
}

### 7) Should FAIL: transporter is actually a CONSIGNEE
POST {{rel}}/GatePasses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "movement": "OUT",
  "container_ID": "21000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
  "deliveryOrder_ID": "61000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
  "transporter_ID": "b1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000006",
  "truckNumber": "KL07AB6666",
  "validFrom": "2026-11-15T00:00:00Z",
  "validTo": "2026-11-19T00:00:00Z"
}

### 8) Should FAIL 409: gate-out before the truck has entered
POST {{rel}}/GatePasses({{passOut}})/ReleaseService.gateOut
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 9) Truck enters → gateInAt set
POST {{rel}}/GatePasses({{passOut}})/ReleaseService.gateIn
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 10) Truck leaves with the container → gateOutAt set, container GATED_OUT
POST {{rel}}/GatePasses({{passOut}})/ReleaseService.gateOut
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 11) Check the container
GET {{cargo}}/Containers({{machinery}})?$select=containerNumber,status_code,gatedOutAt

### 12) Export: announce a container (starts EXPECTED)
POST {{cargo}}/Manifests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "manifestNumber": "EGM-2026-1102",
  "call_ID": "d1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
  "direction_code": "EXP",
  "billsOfLading": [{
    "blNumber": "BWSINCOK2611005",
    "shipper_ID": "b1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005",
    "cargoType_code": "CONT",
    "description": "Spices – black pepper",
    "grossWeightKg": 15000,
    "containers": [ { "ID": "{{exportBox}}", "containerNumber": "BWSU3004006", "type_code": "40GP", "grossWeightKg": 15000 } ]
  }]
}

### 13) IN gate pass for it (GP-2026-0004)
POST {{rel}}/GatePasses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ID": "{{passIn}}",
  "movement": "IN",
  "container_ID": "{{exportBox}}",
  "transporter_ID": "b1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000007",
  "truckNumber": "KL41C5678",
  "validFrom": "2026-11-15T00:00:00Z",
  "validTo": "2026-11-19T00:00:00Z"
}

### 14) Truck brings it in → container GATED_IN
POST {{rel}}/GatePasses({{passIn}})/ReleaseService.gateIn
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 15) Should FAIL 409: gate-in a second time
POST {{rel}}/GatePasses({{passIn}})/ReleaseService.gateIn
Content-Type: application/json

{}